- `beam-web-game-quickstart` — end-to-end path from `beam init` to a deployed, hosted web game
- `beam-test-and-verify` — calling endpoints, probing realtime, logs and smoke tests
- `beam-web-hosting` — hosting the built client (e.g. GitHub Pages)
